  "markup": "\u003Ch2\u003EPotential SKU\u003C/h2\u003E\u003Cp\u003EStrain-identified capsule with documented viable count through expiry.\u003C/p\u003E\u003Ch2\u003EPositioning\u003C/h2\u003E\u003Cp\u003ETransparent strain documentation, shelf stability and formulation quality rather than broad unsupported microbiome promises.\u003C/p\u003E\u003Ch2\u003ECommercial assessment\u003C/h2\u003E\u003Cp\u003EEspecially interesting for Finland, where YouGov found higher category usage than in the other three surveyed Nordic countries. Health-claim restrictions and strain-specific evidence complicate marketing.\u003C/p\u003E"
}]]></Value>
